{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31472","headline":"江楼独酌怀从叔 · 李羣玉","name":"江楼独酌怀从叔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国发爽气，川光静高秋。\n酣歌金尊醁，送此清风愁。\n楚色忽满目，滩声落西楼。\n云翻天边叶，月弄波上钩。\n芳意长摇落，蘅兰谢汀洲。\n长吟碧云合，怅望江之幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}